---
args: {"inbox": "DecisionInbox", "ledger": "DecisionLedger | null"}
returns: "LedgerReview"
---
1. Bind prior = ledger when supplied, otherwise an empty DecisionLedger at revision zero with empty decisions, premises, changes, questions and resolutions. Bind acts = recoverMeetingActs(inbox.meetingAndCorrectionSources, inbox.authority). Read actual source editions; a copied project note is one origin, even after a project rename.
2. Bind decisions = reconstructAdoptions(acts, inbox.cases, prior.decisions). Keep historically adopted decisions and unclosed objections separate; do not invent acceptance or dates.
3. Bind premises = discoverDecisionPremises(decisions, inbox.meetingAndCorrectionSources, prior.premises). Only supported and owner-confirmed necessary links can force reconsideration. Inferred links produce questions.
4. Bind changes = comparePremiseCorrections(premises, prior, acts, inbox). Preserve recorded and effective time. If there is no supported contradiction or narrowing, keep frontier null and retain existing pending questions; editorial changes do not generate owner work.
5. If changes contain a supported contradiction or narrowing, bind frontier = walkReconsiderationFrontier(decisions, premises, changes, prior.questions). Otherwise bind frontier = null and do not create a reconsideration frontier. Its necessary, supporting, independent and cyclic portions remain distinct. When frontier exists, bind routed = routeCurrentReviewOwners(frontier.questions, decisions, inbox); otherwise bind routed = an empty ReviewQuestion list. Replace only the routing on matching question keys, never the decision's historical author.
6. Bind nextQuestions = merge by stable question key: preserve prior unanswered questions outside the frontier, replace only affected questions with their routed current-owner versions, and append newly supported questions without changing answered history. Bind nextLedger: DecisionLedger = { revision: advance only when a new source, decision, premise, change or question was appended or affected routing changed; otherwise preserve prior.revision, decisions: append previously unseen adopted decision identities to prior.decisions, premises: append previously unseen premise-link identities to prior.premises, changes: append previously unseen correction identities to prior.changes, questions: nextQuestions, resolutions: prior.resolutions }. Do not fabricate a resolution or delete an earlier decision revision. Bind view = projectRestrictedLedger(nextLedger, inbox). Return { ledger: nextLedger, frontier, publicEntries: view.publicEntries, restrictedEvidenceMarkers: view.restrictedEvidenceMarkers, unresolved: the exact unresolved source-attribution and authority questions from acts, unreviewed premise links, and still-open review questions in nextQuestions, notifications: one {owner: question.owner, questionKey: question.key, status: "proposed" when question.owner is known and "unknown" otherwise, receiptId: null} per new or changed routed question }. The input contains no delivery receipts, so no notification is marked delivered.
